flowchart LR
  TICK[Raw broker WebSocket tick] --> STREAM[Kafka / Redpanda]
  STREAM --> NORM[Schema validation and stream normalizer]
  NORM --> CH[(ClickHouse raw ticks and EOD)]
  NORM --> LIVE[Coalesced live metric worker]
  LIVE --> REDIS[(Redis latest price and derived metrics)]
  REDIS --> LIVE_API[FastAPI live metrics API under 200 ms]
  LIVE_API --> UI[Live stock UI]

  EOD[Raw market-close EOD price] --> CH
  EOD --> ARCHIVE[(S3 / Parquet immutable archive)]
  FUND[Quarterly EPS and annual balance-sheet release] --> FUND_INGEST[Fundamentals validator and versioner]
  FUND_INGEST --> PG[(PostgreSQL versioned fundamentals)]
  FUND_INGEST --> STREAM

  CH --> ASOF[Temporal as-of join: available_at <= price timestamp]
  PG --> ASOF
  ASOF --> HIST[Historical P/E query and downsampling]
  HIST --> HIST_CACHE[(Redis revisioned historical cache)]
  HIST_CACHE --> HIST_API[FastAPI chart API]
  HIST_API --> CHART[3-year / 5-year P/E chart]

  ARCHIVE --> BACKFILL[Replay and backfill jobs]
  BACKFILL --> CH
  BACKFILL --> PG

